   .. admonition:: Operate with the PWM servo
      :class: note dropdown

      :hwftlbl-act:`SERVO4`

         #. on 0.500 ㎳ ≲ -90°
         #. on 1.500 ㎳ ≅   0°
         #. on 2.500 ㎳ ≳ +90°

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **pwm usec pwm1 0 20000 500**
            :bgn:`uart:~$` **pwm usec pwm1 0 20000 1500**
            :bgn:`uart:~$` **pwm usec pwm1 0 20000 2500**

   .. admonition:: Operate with the white user LED and Buttons as GPIO
      :class: note dropdown

      :hwftlbl-led:`LD4`

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **gpio get gpio1 LD4**
            0

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **gpio conf gpio1 LD4 ol0**

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **gpio set gpio1 LD4 1**
            :bgn:`uart:~$` **gpio set gpio1 LD4 0**

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **gpio blink gpio1 LD4**
            Hit any key to exit

      :hwftlbl-btn:`SW0`

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **gpio get gpio0 SW0**
            0

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **gpio conf gpio0 SW0 iul**
            :bgn:`uart:~$` **gpio get gpio0 SW0**
            0
            :bgn:`uart:~$` **gpio get gpio0 SW0**
            1
            :bgn:`uart:~$` **gpio get gpio0 SW0**
            0

